{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marbies Party</strong> is a chaotic local <strong>party game</strong> playable from <strong>2 to 4</strong>, in which you play as silly little rounded characters running around mazes. Get in your opponents' way as you play a variety of game modes all the way to victory! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FUN AND CHAOS WITH FRIENDS \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players, locally or online using <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/f90e0101d1c0ad6be1082a5a024a7da6.poster.avif?t=1757721066\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/f90e0101d1c0ad6be1082a5a024a7da6.webm?t=1757721066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/f90e0101d1c0ad6be1082a5a024a7da6.mp4?t=1757721066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique Marbie before jumping in!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROCEDURALLY GENERATED MAZES \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/bc298ae73cfbfa802061a1a79cc9b472.poster.avif?t=1757721066\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/bc298ae73cfbfa802061a1a79cc9b472.webm?t=1757721066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/bc298ae73cfbfa802061a1a79cc9b472.mp4?t=1757721066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new maze is generated each time you play: every game is unique!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VARIOUS THEMES \u25d5\u203f\u25d5 *</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a selection of themes to change the scenery, or leave it to chance!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE YOUR FRIENDS IN A VARIETY OF GAME MODES \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COINS RUSH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/8c7854671610e314fdeabc1cae9ee4f5.poster.avif?t=1757721066\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/8c7854671610e314fdeabc1cae9ee4f5.webm?t=1757721066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/8c7854671610e314fdeabc1cae9ee4f5.mp4?t=1757721066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect as many coins as possible and jump into the hole at the center of the maze to score them. Smash crates to obtain unique power-ups that will help you beat your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the other end of the maze before your opponents to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLINDFOLDED *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to find your way in the dark before your opponents to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAYHEM *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for your life in the maze and hit as many opponents as you can to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BATTLE ROYALE *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last Marbie standing wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MARBALL *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically play football... except <i>you</i> are the ball. Score as many points as you can to beat the other team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAWING *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reproduce the picture as best you can by rolling in the snow. The most accurate artist wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKILL *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll you way to the opposite side of the maze without falling!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >T05FIE1PUkUgVEhJTkc=<strong> \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VGhlcmUgbWF5IGJlIG1vcmUgdGhhbiBtZWV0cyB0aGUgZXll</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JH4gbWVtZW50byA9PiA/Pz8/</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* not included in the demo</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648320?t=1757721066","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/633a530d3def897a1fc623f940a19849bf9c991b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757721066","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/06f4a01a0481aa3f52b22eb83176635e9246ada3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757721066","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/06f4a01a0481aa3f52b22eb83176635e9246ada3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757721066","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marbies Party</strong> is a chaotic local <strong>party game</strong> playable from <strong>2 to 4</strong>, in which you play as silly little rounded characters running around mazes. Get in your opponents' way as you play a variety of game modes all the way to victory! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FUN AND CHAOS WITH FRIENDS \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players, locally or online using <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/f90e0101d1c0ad6be1082a5a024a7da6.poster.avif?t=1757721066\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/f90e0101d1c0ad6be1082a5a024a7da6.webm?t=1757721066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/f90e0101d1c0ad6be1082a5a024a7da6.mp4?t=1757721066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique Marbie before jumping in!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROCEDURALLY GENERATED MAZES \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb