ch the other end of the maze before your opponents to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLINDFOLDED *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to find your way in the dark before your opponents to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAYHEM *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for your life in the maze and hit as many opponents as you can to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BATTLE ROYALE *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last Marbie standing wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MARBALL *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically play football... except <i>you</i> are the ball. Score as many points as you can to beat the other team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAWING *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reproduce the picture as best you can by rolling in the snow. The most accurate artist wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKILL *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll you way to the opposite side of the maze without falling!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >T05FIE1PUkUgVEhJTkc=<strong> \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VGhlcmUgbWF5IGJlIG1vcmUgdGhhbiBtZWV0cyB0aGUgZXll</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JH4gbWVtZW50byA9PiA/Pz8/</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* not included in the demo</i></p>","developers":["Heelio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/8aa28ae4bbf4e66ec0a008c69da054eabc994066/header.jpg?t=1757721066","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong>